function parseInteger(v){var s=String(v===undefined?"":v).trim();return/^\d+$/.test(s)?Number(s):null;}function parseHexTokens(v,width,codepoints){var s=String(v===undefined?"":v).trim();if(!s)return null;var parts=s.split(/[\s,;\-]+/).filter(Boolean),out=[];for(var i=0;i<parts.length;i+=1){var p=parts[i].replace(/^U\+/i,"").replace(/^0x/i,"");if(!/^[0-9a-f]+$/i.test(p))return null;var n=parseInt(p,16);if(codepoints?!isScalar(n):n<0||n>width)return null;out.push(n);}return out;}function sameList(a,b){return a!==null&&b!==null&&a.length===b.length&&a.every(function(v,i){return v===b[i];});}
function normalizeField(f,v){if(f.kind==="choice")return String(v===undefined?"":v);if(f.kind==="integer")return parseInteger(v);if(f.kind==="bytes")return parseHexTokens(v,255,false);if(f.kind==="units")return parseHexTokens(v,65535,false);if(f.kind==="codepoint")return(parseHexTokens(v,0,true)||[])[0];if(f.kind==="codepoints")return parseHexTokens(v,0,true);if(f.kind==="offsets"){var s=String(v===undefined?"":v).trim();return s? s.split(/[\s,;]+/).filter(Boolean).map(Number):null;}if(f.kind==="hex"){var s2=String(v===undefined?"":v).trim().replace(/^0x/i,"");return/^[0-9a-f]+$/i.test(s2)?parseInt(s2,16):null;}return String(v===undefined?"":v).trim();}
